    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 2 Ridgewood Avenue to the open market. This impressive 4-bedroom semi-detached family home offers an excellent balance of generous living space and modern functionality, further enhanced by a substantial rear bright, sunny extension.\n\nExtending to a spacious and well-designed layout, this property provides an ideal setting for comfortable family living. The ground floor accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hall with Guest WC, leading into a bright and spacious living room to the front with French doors into the kitchen. To the rear, the home opens into an expansive open-plan kitchen and dining area, forming the heart of the home and perfectly suited to both everyday living and entertaining. The extended kitchen / diner adds a further versatile living space, flooded with natural light and overlooking the rear garden. A separate utility/laundry room complete the downstairs accommodation, offering excellent practicality.\n\nUpstairs, the property comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms. The primary en-suite bedroom is generously sized and positioned to the front of the property, while the remaining bedrooms offer ample space for family members, guests, or home office use. A family bathroom ensures convenience for a busy household.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from its semi-detached positioning, with side access and a private rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining or family use.\nNo. 2 Ridgewood Avenue represents a superb opportunity to acquire a spacious, extended family home in a mature and highly sought-after residential location. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space and potential this fine property has to offer.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.76m (5'9\") x 5.22m (17'2\")\n-Solid wood flooring \n-Understairs storage \n-Guest W.C\n\nGuest W.C - 0.62m (2'0\") x 1.98m (6'6\")\n-Fully tiled\n-W.C & WHB \nRadiator\n\nLounge - 3.58m (11'9\") x 5.84m (19'2\")\n-Solid wood flooring \n-French doors to kitchen/diner\n\nKitchen - 8.68m (28'6\") x 5.3m (17'5\")\n-Tiled floor\n-Kitchen island with storage \n-Skylights\n-Sliding doors to rear \n\n\nUtility - 1.3m (4'3\") x 2.11m (6'11\")\n-Tiled floors\n-Space for washer/dryer\n\nLanding - 3.02m (9'11\") x 3.17m (10'5\")\n-Carpet \n-Access to attic \n-Hot press\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.45m (14'7\") x 2.77m (9'1\")\n-Laminated wood flooring\n-Built in wardrobes \n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.45m (4'9\") x 1.67m (5'6\")\n-Fully tiled\n-WC & WHB \n-Shower tray \n-Heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.69m (12'1\") x 2.58m (8'6\")\n-Laminated wood flooring \n-Built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.82m (9'3\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\n-Laminated wood flooring\n-Built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.82m (9'3\") x 2.24m (7'4\")\n-Laminated wood flooring \n-Built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 1.76m (5'9\") x 1.85m (6'1\")\n-Fully tiled\n-WC & WHB \n-Bath \n-Shower attachment\n\n"
      },
